<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work6823948> a ns1:Report ;
    rdfs:label "T den ganzen Himm"@de-DE,
        "Ne first very yo"@en-CA,
        "Ne first very yo"@en-US,
        "As. Menor. Dios r"@es,
