<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work7370306> a ns1:Patent ;
    rdfs:label "Agen Sie nicht, Meere, unser Geflü"@de-DE,
        "Rth days cattle may. Dominion cree"@en-CA,
        "Rth days cattle may. Dominion cree"@en-US,
