    rdfs:label "Ten der Wale bist du ein weibliches Kreaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel"@de-DE,
        "Eginning beginning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'l"@en-CA,
