<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work4104833> a ns2:Video ;
    rdfs:label "Em Menschen. Vo"@de-DE,
        "H of man. Of ni"@en-CA,
        "H of man. Of ni"@en-US,
        "El hombre. Desd"@es,
        "E l'homme. Du d"@fr-CA,
