<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work6816945> a ns1:Report ;
    rdfs:label "N der Nacht an we"@de-DE,
        "Inning bring a ev"@en-CA,
        "Inning bring a ev"@en-US,
        "Mienzo de la noch"@es,
