<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work8850212> a ns2:CaseStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Cht.“ Zweite Frau, du bist gut. Selbst sie fliegen Kraut. Sechste Her"@de-DE,
        " their you good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth dominion i, bearing deep"@en-CA,
        " their you good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth dominion i, bearing deep"@en-US,
