<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work1752028> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Eniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel versammelt, von Anfang an ist es"@de-DE,
        "T said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply rule. Said fi"@en-CA,
        "T said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply rule. Said fi"@en-US,
