<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work2315187> a ns2:Speech ;
    rdfs:label "Ben. Baum aus dem Menschen. Von Beginn"@de-DE,
        "Ving. Tree forth of man. Of night begi"@en-CA,
        "Ving. Tree forth of man. Of night begi"@en-US,
        "Viendo. Árbol del hombre. Desde el com"@es,
