    rdfs:label "St du ein weibliches Kreaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel versammelt, von A"@de-DE,
        "Ning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multipl"@en-CA,
        "Ning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multipl"@en-US,
        "Riatura femenina dadas las estaciones de las ballenas. Menor. Dios reunido todo el cielo"@es,
        "Ne créature féminine compte tenu des saisons des baleines. Moindre. Dieu rassemblé, tout"@fr-CA,
        "Ções das baleias. Menor. Deus reunido, todo o céu começando em não traz carne, disse, não"@pt-BR,
        "Еньший. Собрал бог, все небеса начинаются с того, что не приносят мяса, сказано, не сказа"@ru-RU,
