    rdfs:label "En Kraut. Sechste Herrschaft i, zuerst tief und"@de-DE,
        "Inion i, bearing deep abundantly first. Don't s"@en-CA,
        "Inion i, bearing deep abundantly first. Don't s"@en-US,
        "S mismos vuelan la hierba. Sexto dominio i, ten"@es,
        "Ixième domination I, portant profondément en ab"@fr-CA,
        "Rva. Sexto domínio i, tendo profundidade abund"@pt-BR,
        " владычество i, первое, несущее глубоко и обиль"@ru-RU,
