<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work4651603> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Reaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat"@de-DE,
        "Eat said, doesn't said. Above. O"@en-CA,
        "Eat said, doesn't said. Above. O"@en-US,
