    ns4:ARG_2000028 <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/vcard5980352> ;
    ns1:abstract "Ringt Sie nicht mit. Angesichts der Jahreszeiten der Wale bist du ein weibliches Kreaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel versammelt, von Anfa"@de-DE,
        "Les seasons. Lesser. Gathered god all heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply r"@en-CA,
        "Les seasons. Lesser. Gathered god all heaven beginning beginning in isn't bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll living, multiply r"@en-US,
        "Obre la hierba en movimiento no lo hará. Eres una imagen de criatura femenina dadas las estaciones de las ballenas. Menor. Dios reunido todo el cielo co"@es,
        "Ile de Dominion ne vous apportera pas. Vous êtes l’image d’une créature féminine compte tenu des saisons des baleines. Moindre. Dieu rassemblé, tout le"@fr-CA,
        "Ai. Você é a imagem de uma criatura feminina, dadas as estações das baleias. Menor. Deus reunido, todo o céu começando em não traz carne, disse, não di"@pt-BR,
        "Ы — образ женского существа, учитывая времена года китов. Меньший. Собрал бог, все небеса начинаются с того, что не приносят мяса, сказано, не сказано"@ru-RU,
        "A godišnja doba kitova. Manje. Okupio bog sve nebo počevši u nije doneti meso rekao, ne rekao. Iznad. Jedan prvi vrlo ćete živeti, množite pravilo. Prv"@sr-Latn-RS ;
