<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work5398015> a ns1:Report ;
    rdfs:label "Hen. Von Beginn der Nacht an w"@de-DE,
        ". Of night beginning bring a e"@en-CA,
        ". Of night beginning bring a e"@en-US,
