<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work5989529> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Aum aus dem Menschen. Von Beginn der Nacht an we"@de-DE,
        "Ree forth of man. Of night beginning bring a ev"@en-CA,
        "Ree forth of man. Of night beginning bring a ev"@en-US,
